      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><strong>Our mechs were born in space protecting ships from raiders. They are designed from the ground up for zero-g work.</strong></p><p>Mechs are easier to build in space dock and are mainly used in space itself. While they are capable of battle on a planet’s surface, they are much slower and plodding there.</p><p><em>Quest Starter: Starting Module: Give all mechs the EVA module for free at build time.</em></p>"
      },
      "video": {
