    {
      "sort": 200000,
      "name": "34 - 67",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "80d0t9Fq4cFbY9xE",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><strong>The mechs we utilize were build to fly in the atmosphere.</strong></p><p>As we settled on planet after planet, we quickly realized the need for rapid response times to emergencies. To accommodate the need for speed and combat, we build our mechs with flight systems.</p><p><em>Quest Starter: Starting Module: Give all mechs the Flight System module for free at build time and the Zephyr the EVA module.</em></p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
