    {
      "sort": 300000,
      "name": "68 - 100",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "63co89mDZOfxqvOV",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><strong>Mechs are our main source of protection on the ground, but other vehicles are better suited for atmospheric flight or zero-g protection duty.</strong></p><p>Mechs are designed for the gravity of specific planetary surfaces. Trying to make them adaptable proved too difficult of an engineering challenge, and transporting mechs to other planets is far too expensive.</p><p><em>Quest Starter: Starting Module: Give all mechs the Heavy Armor module for free at build time and the Gladiator the Inertial Dampeners module.</em></p>"
      },
